            "review_title": "Review at Mùa Craft Sake",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20962 contributions\n1\nVietnamese food by Japanese way\nOct 2025 • Business\nEntrance hidden behind bush or three making natural wall between restaurant and narrow street. Some tables outside under the roof on terrace and majority of area is inside in air conditioned place. Japanese inspired Vietnamese cuisine, salads seafood 🍤and meat 🍖 dishes. Tasty 😋 meals nicely decorated on plates. Saké beer 🍺 or normal draft beer with option of different fruit drinks\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nReservation is practical\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 22, 2025",
