            "review_title": "Review at Mùa Craft Sake",
            "review_text": "Guide15196633572\n5 contributions\n0\nMust-Visit for Sake Lovers\nJan 2025 • Family\nMùa Craft Sake is a hidden gem for sake enthusiasts. Their handcrafted sake is smooth, flavorful, and expertly brewed, offering a taste that rivals even top Japanese brands.\n\nThe cozy ambiance, delicious food pairings, and exceptional service make this place truly special. The staff is knowledgeable and passionate, always ready to guide you through the menu.\n\nWhether you're a sake lover or just curious to try, this is a must-visit spot in Vietnam. Highly recommended\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTry Sake Flights, you will have chance to taste different kind of Sakes. This is 3 flavors each time.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 12, 2025",
