            "review_text": "Nguyen Thanh The\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam139 contributions\n0\nShop taken 50% value from customer by poured beer only 50% of glass.\nAug 2024 • Friends\nThe Shop pour only half of glass for order 1 tap beer. Cheated 50% value from guest already. \nI sent comment to Mùa Fanpage messenger but did not receive response.\nWritten August 29, 2024\nScenic41177820681\nDear Daniel,\n\nI hope you are doing well. On behalf of the MÙA team, I sincerely apologize for our delayed response on Tripadvisor and for the unsatisfactory experience you recently had with us. \n\nWe understand that some time has passed since your visit, and although our staff has reached out to you before, it’s clear we have not yet resolved your concerns. We have reflected deeply on this matter, and it truly pains us to know that we have not met your expectations, for any reason.\n\nWe genuinely hope you will consider visiting MÙA again in the near future. We are committed to improving our service quality and guest experience to ensure your satisfaction.\n\nThank you for your understanding, and we look forward to the opportunity to welcome you back.\n\nBest regards, \nMÙA Team\nRead more\nWritten September 25, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
